    <!--
        §20 inter-node host-socket routing (A3, decision H5): the routing
        node of a host instance's socket. Changelog 018 already shipped the
        column this relay needs — agent_host_instances.control_node_id —
        stamped at host.open from NodeRegistryService.getSelfNodeId(), the
        exact source the wire's host.opened.serverNodeId reports. A second
        server_node_id column would be a redundant duplicate of that value
        (no-redundant-columns rule), so this changeset deliberately does NOT
        add a new column; it exists to keep the changelog numbering unambiguous
        and to document the reuse. If a future wave redefines the routing
        identity independently of the control-socket owner, add the column
        here under the next free number.
    -->

</databaseChangeLog>